<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We always want your journey with us to be enjoyable, so I'm sorry to hear you were disappointed with the cabin on board your flight from {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} to {{{Case.Arrival_Airport__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
When booking via the Qantas website&nbsp;you can see which aircraft will be operating each flight by clicking on the red flight number. This may help you decide which flight best suits your needs.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
We’re constantly making improvements to our in-flight experience, so I’ve passed on your comments about the current product to our In-flight Product and Service Development team.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and I hope that we can make you more comfortable next time you travel with us.</p>
